<title>USA: U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn major net sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p> Net Sales:	 1996/97		     1997/98</p>
<p>  Taiwan	   231,300			    Nil</p>
<p>  Unknown	  171,500</p>
<p>  Japan	     83,400</p>
<p>  Malaysia	  70,000</p>
<p>  Ecuador	   56,000</p>
<p>Sales of 822,300 tonnes were 28 percent above the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 439,800 tonnes were 19 percent above the previoius week, but one-fifth below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Japan, Egypt, Mexico and Tunisia.</p>
</text>
